      "content": "integrity doesnt pay the bills or bring back the life i had. everyone i knew just turned their back on me because it was \"too much drama.\" it's like the more you try to be a decent human, the more the world punishes you for it. what's even the point of trying to be good if the truth just gets you buried? it feels like there's no way back from this.",
